# (build 160) The Escape menu's GAMEPAD row (above QUIT, so COMPUTER PLAYS
# and SPEED stay where routes find them) and its page: PAD 1 and PAD 2 --
# NONE, the probe has no gamepads -- and RUMBLE, MEDIUM by default. Left
# and right step it and stop at OFF and HIGH; C goes round. A, B or C on a
# PAD row with no gamepad does nothing; Escape or B goes back to the menu.

start new
wait screen title
press esc
expect escape-menu open
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down
press down                   # GAMEPAD
shot 01_menu
press c
shot 02_page
expect setting rumble medium
press c                      # PAD 1: no gamepad, nothing
expect setting rumble medium
press down
press down                   # RUMBLE
press right
expect setting rumble high
press right                  # stops at HIGH
expect setting rumble high
press left
press left
press left
expect setting rumble off
press left                   # stops at OFF
expect setting rumble off
press c                      # round: OFF to LOW
expect setting rumble low
shot 03_low
press b                      # back to the menu
expect escape-menu open
press esc
expect escape-menu closed
